{% comment %}
  Renders a special label for duration variant options with badges and price per day calculation.

  Accepts:
  - input_id: {String} ID of the input element
  - value: {Object} Current option value
  - option: {Object} Current product option
  - product: {Object} Product object
  - label_unavailable: {String} HTML for unavailable label
  - is_first: {Boolean} Whether this is the first option value
  - discount_percentage: {String} Discount percentage to display (e.g. "10" for 10%)

  Usage:
  {% render 'product-variant-label-duration',
    input_id: input_id,
    value: value,
    option: option,
    product: product,
    label_unavailable: label_unavailable,
    is_first: forloop.first,
    discount_percentage: block.settings.discount_percentage
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign variant_price = 0
  assign option_index = option.position | minus: 1

  comment
    Extraction des mois et calcul des jours depuis la valeur du variant
    Supporte: "1 mois", "3 mois", "12 mois", "1M", "3M", "1 month", etc.
    Validation du format avant calcul
  endcomment
  assign months = 0
  assign days = 0
  assign value_string = value | downcase | strip
  assign value_parts = value_string | split: ' '
  assign first_part = value_parts[0]
  assign cleaned_part = first_part | replace: 'm', '' | replace: 'mois', '' | replace: 'month', '' | replace: 'mo', '' | strip
  assign months = cleaned_part | plus: 0

  if months == 0 or months < 1
    assign first_char = value_string | slice: 0, 1
    assign months = first_char | plus: 0
    if months == 0
      assign first_two_chars = value_string | slice: 0, 2
      assign months = first_two_chars | plus: 0
    endif
  endif

  if months < 1 or months > 120
    assign months = 0
  endif

  if months > 0
    assign days = months | times: 30
  endif

  comment
    Recherche optimisée du variant
    Priorité 1: value.variant (le plus rapide)
    Priorité 2: Recherche directe par option_index si possible
    Priorité 3: Boucle sur tous les variants (fallback)
  endcomment
  if value.variant
    assign variant_price = value.variant.price
  else
    comment
      Essayer de trouver le variant correspondant à cette valeur d'option
      On cherche uniquement les variants qui ont cette valeur à la bonne position
    endcomment
    for variant in product.variants
      if variant.options[option_index] == value
        assign variant_price = variant.price
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    Formatage des données pour JavaScript
    Utilisation de la locale pour l'internationalisation
  endcomment
  assign locale = request.locale.iso_code | default: shop.locale | default: 'fr-FR'

  comment
    Calcul du prix par jour côté serveur pour affichage initial
    (visible avant que JavaScript ne charge - fallback pour le rendu initial)
    IMPORTANT: Ce calcul garantit que le texte est visible au chargement de la page
    Alpine.js prendra le relais pour le formatage précis une fois chargé
  endcomment
  assign price_per_day_text = ''
  if variant_price > 0 and days > 0 and days != blank
    comment
      Calcul simple : prix en centimes / jours
      Liquid ne gère pas bien les décimales, donc on utilise le filtre money de Shopify
      pour un formatage approximatif mais visible
    endcomment
    assign price_per_day_cents = variant_price | divided_by: days
    assign price_per_day_prefix = 'products.product.variant.price_per_day_prefix' | t
    assign price_per_day_suffix = 'products.product.variant.price_per_day_suffix' | t

    comment
      Utiliser le filtre money pour formater le prix (approximatif mais visible)
      Le filtre money inclut déjà le symbole de devise
      Format: "X,XX €" - Alpine.js améliorera le formatage précis ensuite
    endcomment
    if price_per_day_cents > 0
      assign price_per_day_formatted = price_per_day_cents | money
      assign price_per_day_text = price_per_day_prefix | append: ' ' | append: price_per_day_formatted | append: ' ' | append: price_per_day_suffix
    endif
  endif
-%}

<label
  for="{{ input_id }}"
  class="variant-card-label"
  data-price-per-day-prefix="{{ 'products.product.variant.price_per_day_prefix' | t }}"
  data-price-per-day-suffix="{{ 'products.product.variant.price_per_day_suffix' | t }}"
  data-currency-symbol="{{ cart.currency.symbol }}"
  data-locale="{{ locale }}"
  x-data="
    variantDurationLabel({
      price: {{ variant_price }},
      days: {{ days }},
      prefix: $el.dataset.pricePerDayPrefix,
      suffix: $el.dataset.pricePerDaySuffix,
      currencySymbol: $el.dataset.currencySymbol,
      locale: $el.dataset.locale
    })
  "
>
  {%- if is_first -%}
    <span class="variant-badge variant-badge--discovery">
      {{- 'products.product.variant.discovery_badge' | t -}}
    </span>
  {%- else -%}
    <span class="variant-badge variant-badge--best">{{ 'products.product.variant.best_offer_badge' | t }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
  <span class="variant-main-text">{{ value }}</span>
  <span class="variant-sub-text-wrapper">
    {%- unless is_first -%}
      {%- if discount_percentage != blank -%}
        <span class="variant-discount-badge">-{{ discount_percentage }}%</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
    <span class="variant-sub-text" x-text="pricePerDayText">{{ price_per_day_text }}</span>
  </span>
  {{ label_unavailable }}
</label>
